{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>Planks of acacia wood, standing.</b> Its plain sense: do not take from those that fell and were cut long ago and have already rotted, but from those standing at their full height. Another interpretation: 'standing' — that they stand forever and ever, and they still exist and are hidden away."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:04:05.509437033Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}